                `lint.isort.required-imports` (I002) conflicts with \
                `unaliased-collections-abc-set-import` (PYI025), which requires this import to be \
                aliased as `AbstractSet`.\n\
                Either alias the required import \
                (`from collections.abc import Set as AbstractSet`), or disable PYI025."
            ));
        }
    }

    Ok(())
